<!-- ── WISP BRAND PROMISES — Blue ── -->
<section class="wisp">
  <div class="wisp-inner">
    <div class="wisp-intro">
      <div>
        <div class="stag-b">Why Our Internet is Different</div>
        <h2 class="sh-b">We're not a big ISP.<br/><em>We're your ISP.</em></h2>
        <p class="sb-b" style="margin-bottom:0">We're a licensed WISP — which means we own the infrastructure, we write the rules, and we answer to you instead of shareholders. No throttling your traffic because a streaming service didn't pay us. No selling your browsing data. No pretending the outage isn't happening. Just the internet, the way it was supposed to work.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="wisp-tagline">
        "Rules are for big ISPs.<br/>
        Internet connections aren't."
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="wisp-promises">

      <div class="wisp-promise">
        <div class="wisp-promise-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1A9FE0" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round">
            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
            <path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <span class="promise-tag">Net Neutrality</span>
        <h3>Your data. Your traffic. Your rules.</h3>
        <p>We're an independent ISP — which means <strong>we never throttle, cap, or sell your data.</strong> No traffic shaping. No priority lanes for paying partners. Every byte treated equally, the way the internet was meant to work.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="wisp-promise">
        <div class="wisp-promise-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1A9FE0" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round">
            <path d="M1.5 8.5a13 13 0 0 1 21 0"/>
            <path d="M5 12a9 9 0 0 1 14 0"/>
            <path d="M8.5 15.5a5 5 0 0 1 7 0"/>
            <circle cx="12" cy="19" r="1" fill="#1A9FE0"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <span class="promise-tag">Wireless-First · WISP</span>
        <h3>Up in days. Not months.</h3>
        <p>We're a licensed WISP — so you get a choice: <strong>all-wireless deployment</strong> for fast, clean installs with zero trenching, or a <strong>hardened Ethernet option</strong> when you need the extra reliability. No contractors. No conduit. No waiting.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="wisp-promise">
        <div class="wisp-promise-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1A9FE0" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round">
            <polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <span class="promise-tag">Quality Over Quantity</span>
        <h3>We don't sell you a number.</h3>
        <p>Big ISPs advertise "up to" speeds that collapse under real-world load. We engineer for <strong>consistent, low-latency bandwidth that performs under pressure.</strong> Quality of bandwidth matters more than the number on a brochure.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="wisp-promise">
        <div class="wisp-promise-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1A9FE0" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round">
            <path d="M12 22V12"/>
            <path d="M12 12C12 12 8 9 8 6a4 4 0 0 1 8 0c0 3-4 6-4 6z"/>
            <path d="M8 22h8"/>
            <path d="M5 19c-1.5-1-2-3-2-5 0-3 2-5 5-5"/>
            <path d="M19 19c1.5-1 2-3 2-5 0-3-2-5-5-5"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <span class="promise-tag">Environmentally Friendly</span>
        <h3>No digging. Lighter footprint.</h3>
        <p>Traditional fiber ISPs trench up your parking lot, lay miles of conduit, and leave a construction mess. <strong>Our wireless-first approach means zero ground disruption</strong> — smaller environmental footprint, faster deployment, and no lasting damage to your property.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="wisp-promise" style="border-color:rgba(26,159,224,0.25);background:rgba(26,159,224,0.08);">
        <div class="wisp-promise-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1A9FE0" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round">
            <path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <span class="promise-tag" style="background:rgba(26,159,224,0.15);color:var(--sky);">Signature Approach</span>
        <h3>We fingerprint your network. Then we defend it.</h3>
        <p>Every HowdyNET network gets a behavioral baseline — we log and learn what healthy traffic looks like for your specific business. <strong>Anything outside that fingerprint gets flagged and blocked.</strong> Not just known threats — unknown traffic too. Most businesses have no idea what's on their own network. We do, and we keep it that way.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
